OL,3,ADesigner's diamond watch cut off wrist,
OL,4,Acourt told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fashion designer was robbed of a
OL,7,Fwatch valued at more than #137,000
OL,8,F(bB,160,000) when it was cut from his
OL,9,Fwrist outside a restaurant in London's
OL,10,FMayfair, a court has heard.
OL,12,FAli Eldahouzze, 22, and Abdel El
OL,13,FHabchi, 30, are accused of stealing the
OL,14,Fdiamond-encrusted Richard Mille watch
OL,15,Ffrom Romanian entrepreneur Catalin
OL,16,FBotezatu.
OL,18,FThe pair each deny one count of
OL,19,Frobbery, while a third man - Younes
OL,20,FDjoudi - has admitted the charge.
